Ground textures

  art/textures-src/*.jpg and the arrays packed from them in
  public/textures/ground/ are CC0 1.0 sets from ambientCG (ambientcg.com) and
  Poly Haven (polyhaven.com). No attribution is required; LICENSES.md lists
  each set and its source. Most recently added: Ground077 (pine forest floor),
  https://ambientcg.com/view?id=Ground077.


"Very fast procedural ocean" by afl_ext
---------------------------------------

  src/render/water.ts
    The wave sum (waterWaves), the three-sample normal, the distance
    smoothing of the normal and the crest-lit scattering term are a GLSL
    port of "Very fast procedural ocean" by afl_ext, Shadertoy MdXyzX
    (https://www.shadertoy.com/view/MdXyzX), 2017, by way of the TSL port
    in the GolfCartSimulator project (apps/web/src/env/oceanWaves.ts), whose
    still-pond settings are used. The reflection, foam, shoreline fade and
    ripple rings are this project's own.

    Copyright (c) 2017 by afl_ext.

