Free drive (drive/)

  drive/ is TeeTimeTurrets' free-drive mode, formerly the GolfCartSimulator
  repository. Its third-party data and assets, with their terms, are listed in
  drive/ATTRIBUTION.md: the NC 2024 QL1 lidar DEMs and NC OneMap
  orthoimagery (NC public data), an OpenStreetMap snapshot
  (c) OpenStreetMap contributors, ODbL 1.0, and the afl_ext ocean shader
  (drive/apps/web/src/env/oceanWaves.ts, under the notice reproduced above).
